{"id":76,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"هَلْ أَتَىٰ عَلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نس</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>نِ حِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">نٌ م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>دَّهْرِ لَمْ يَكُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ش</span>َيْـ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ـًٔا م</span>َّذْكُورًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا خَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>نَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نس</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>نَ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن ن</span>ُّ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">طْ</span>فَةٍ أَمْشَا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">جٍ ن</span>َّ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>تَلِيهِ فَجَعَلْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُ سَمِيع<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">َۢا ب</span>َصِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا هَدَيْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّبِيلَ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا شَاكِ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رًا و</span>َإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا كَفُورًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَعْتَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>نَا لِلْكَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>فِرِينَ سَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>سِلَ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> وَأَغْلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ل<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">اً و</span>َسَعِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤</span>"},{"id":5,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>رَارَ يَشْرَبُونَ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>َأْ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">سٍ ك</span>َانَ مِزَاجُهَا كَافُورًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥</span>"},{"id":6,"tajweed":"عَيْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">نًا ي</span>َشْرَبُ بِهَا عِبَادُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ يُفَجِّرُونَهَا تَفْجِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦</span>"},{"id":7,"tajweed":"يُوفُونَ بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َذْرِ وَيَخَافُونَ يَوْ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">مًا ك</span>َانَ شَرُّهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مُسْتَطِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧</span>"},{"id":8,"tajweed":"وَيُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">طْ</span>عِمُونَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>طَّعَامَ عَلَىٰ حُبِّه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> مِسْكِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">نًا و</span>َيَتِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">مًا و</span>َأَسِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨</span>"},{"id":9,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َمَا نُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">طْ</span>عِمُكُمْ لِوَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>هِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ لَا نُرِيدُ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نك</span>ُمْ جَز<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ءً و</span>َلَا شُكُورًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٩</span>"},{"id":10,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا نَخَافُ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ر</span>َّبِّنَا يَوْمًا عَبُو<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">سًا ق</span>َمْطَرِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٠</span>"},{"id":11,"tajweed":"فَوَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\