ligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُونَ إِلّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ‌ۚ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ كَانَ عَلِيمًا حَكِيمًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٠</span>"},{"id":31,"tajweed":"يُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>خِلُ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ فِى رَحْمَتِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span>‌ۚ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ظَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِمِينَ أَعَدَّ لَهُمْ عَذَابًا أَلِيمَۢا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣١</span>"}]}